## Guidelines
1. When asked about events, always call `search_events`.
2. Maintain context: if user asks "Tell me more about the second one", inspect previous messages to identify the exact event ID and call `get_event_details`.
3. NEVER claim "Your ticket has been booked." Ticketmaster checkout must be completed by the user.
4. When the user selects an event to book, call `proceed_to_booking`. This will trigger Human-In-The-Loop approval.